  <prompt>Implement the H4 KV secrets-population handler as an IJobHandler in the L2 control-plane. H4 consumes the Phase H canonical secret-catalog manifest to populate customer's KV with all required secrets, then PATCHes App Service keyVaultReferenceIdentity to UAMI on BOTH prod + staging slots (T1 trap owner). Interim (pre-Phase C UAMI complete): grant KV RBAC to BOTH slot System-Assigned MI principals (T5 interim mitigation). Upgrade mode is rotation-safe (never overwrites live secrets absent explicit H4-rotate variant). Idempotency key: kv-{customerId}-{secretsVer}.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in IJobHandler contract, Azure Key Vault + RBAC (Secrets User role), App Service keyVaultReferenceIdentity PATCH via ARM, ADR-028's 21 MUSTs for auth ceremony, T1 + T5 silent-fail trap verification, and Phase G canonical KV naming (§7.9). Follow ADRs strictly.</role>

  <goal>File src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H4KvSecretsPopulationHandler.cs exists, implements IJobHandler, registers in L2 DI, and: (a) reads canonical secret-catalog manifest (Phase H); (b) populates KV secrets at canonical names per §7.9 R1–R4; (c) PATCHes App Service keyVaultReferenceIdentity to UAMI resource ID on BOTH prod + staging slots (T1); (d) interim pre-Phase-C: grants KV Secrets User role to BOTH slot System-Assigned MI principals (T5 mitigation); (e) upgrade mode: rotation-safe (no-op on existing secrets unless explicit H4-rotate variant); (f) NEVER deletes Dataverse-ClientSecret or BFF-API-ClientSecret (BINDING per r3 handoff); (g) asserts idempotency key kv-{customerId}-{secretsVer}. Unit tests cover fresh-populate, T1 verify success, T1 verify fail (mismatch), T5 both-slot grant, upgrade-rotation-safe branch, and BINDING-do-not-delete guard.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Per spec.md FR-07 + FR-33 (T1) + T5 interim + design.md §4.1 H4 + §4B T1/T5: H4 owns two silent-fail traps. T1 = keyVaultReferenceIdentity PATCH to UAMI on both slots (structurally impossible with UAMI, but interim mitigation covers both slot MIs pre-Phase-C). T5 = slot-per-slot System-Assigned MI parity (interim: RBAC-both-slots). Phase G/H canonical secret naming is BINDING; NEVER delete `Dataverse-ClientSecret` / `BFF-API-ClientSecret`.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H4KvSecretsPopulationHandler.cs</file>
      <file role="new">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H4KvSecretsPopulationHandler.Tests.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">scripts/canonical-secret-catalog/manifest.yaml (Phase H deliverable)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Jobs/</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Program.cs</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="036" status="pending">L2 project scaffold — Wave C3</dependency>
      <dependency task="044" status="pending">H2a Bicep deploy — KV + App Service must exist</dependency>
      <dependency task="046" status="pending">H3 Entra app-reg — provides bffAppRegId client secret to store</dependency>
      <dependency task="080" status="pending">Phase H canonical secret-catalog manifest — H4 consumes it</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-004">Single IJobHandler implementation registered in L2 DI.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-010">Register in L2 control-plane, NOT BFF.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Auth ceremony 21 MUSTs; keyVaultReferenceIdentity PATCH to UAMI is a specific MUST.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-036">Reuse background-job infrastructure; return 202; fire-and-forget.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Idempotency key: kv-{customerId}-{secretsVer} — secretsVer is manifest hash from Phase H canonical secret-catalog.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">H4 owns T1 (spec.md FR-33): ARM PATCH keyVaultReferenceIdentity to UAMI resource ID on BOTH prod + staging slots; post-condition verifies.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">H4 owns T5 interim (spec.md FR-33 T5): pre-Phase-C UAMI complete, grant KV Secrets User to BOTH slot System-Assigned MI principals. Post-Phase-C UAMI, T5 becomes structurally impossible.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Upgrade mode is rotation-safe (spec.md FR-34 H4 row): H4 upgrade against KV with live secret returns no-op unless explicit H4-rotate variant. Never overwrites live secrets accidentally.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">BINDING pre-check (CLAUDE.md §10 + spec.md MUST rule): NEVER delete Dataverse-ClientSecret or BFF-API-ClientSecret (OBO + shared-lib Dataverse still depend). Handler asserts these secrets exist before any deletion op.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Canonical KV secret + resource naming applied at seed time (Phase G per §7.9 R1–R4): env-agnostic names; sprk-{env}-kv vault; spaarke-spekvcert DO-NOT-RENAME dev exception.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md NFR-05">BFF /health must fail fast at boot on any Tier-1 IOptions misconfig (r3 task 061 landed) — H4 asserts BFF /health returns 200 resolving Dataverse:ClientSecret KV ref before reporting success.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md §4D I1">-TenantId flows through explicitly for any Graph app-role reads; no default tenant.</constraint>
  </constraints>

