**Traps + BINDING pre-check verified via tests**:
- T1 PATCH failure → QuarantineRequired
- T1 ARM verify mismatch after PATCH → QuarantineRequired
- T5 Granted / NoSystemAssigned (post-Phase-C) → Success
- T5 grant failure → Resumable (INTERIM classification)
- BINDING pre-check: `Dataverse-ClientSecret` + `BFF-API-ClientSecret` Delete ops → QuarantineRequired BEFORE any writer/patcher call (grep-zero confirmed via unit test)
- Idempotency key `kv-{customerId}-{secretsVer}`; upgrade mode rotation-safe by default (spec.md FR-34)

